  "A backup holds everything Erevos keeps on {device}: every space, with its contacts, messages, photos, files, voice messages, imported chats and hidden chats, each still sealed with its own password, and the settings that go with you to another device. The backup has a password of its own too. Its photos, files and voice messages go in files of their own beside it. An automatic backup also needs files of the ones before it: keep the whole folder.":
    "Rezervna kopija sadrži sve što Erevos čuva na {device}: svaki prostor, s kontaktima, porukama, fotografijama, datotekama, glasovnim porukama, uvezenim i skrivenim razgovorima, svaki i dalje šifriran vlastitom lozinkom, i postavke koje idu s vama na drugi uređaj. I sama rezervna kopija ima vlastitu lozinku. Njene fotografije, datoteke i glasovne poruke idu u zasebne datoteke pored nje. Automatska rezervna kopija treba i datoteke prethodnih: čuvajte cijeli folder.",
